---
import SiteLayout from "../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "August 31, 2026";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Canless Terms of Use - bneuhausz.dev"
  description="Terms of use for the Canless Android app."
  canonical="https://bneuhausz.dev/apps/canless/terms/"
>
  <section
    class="prose dark:prose-invert text-left max-w-screen-md mx-auto px-8 pb-16"
  >
    <p class="text-sm text-amber-200/70">
      <a href="/apps/canless/">← Back to Canless</a>
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-3xl">Canless — Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-amber-200/70">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      These terms are the agreement between you and Bálint Neuhausz (Hungary)
      ("we", "us") for your use of the <strong>Canless</strong> Android app
      (the "App"). By installing or using the App you agree to them; if you do
      not agree, do not use the App. Business details are in the <a
        href="/imprint/">Imprint</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">1. Licence</h2>
    <p>
      We grant you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to
      install and use the App on devices you control. You may not sell, rent,
      reverse-engineer, or redistribute it, except where such a restriction is
      prohibited by law. Your use is also subject to
