    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">2. Not medical advice</h2>
    <p>
      The App is a habit tracker and an educational tool. Canless is not a
      medical device and does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any
      medical condition. If you have questions about caffeine and your
      health, talk to a healthcare professional. The health information the
      App shows is general, cites its sources, and is not advice about your
      individual situation; nothing in the App is a substitute for
      professional medical advice, and you use the counters, the timeline and
      the taper at your own judgement.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">3. Your data</h2>
    <p>
      What you record in the App stays on your device (see the
      <a href="/apps/canless/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>). You are responsible
      for any backup files you export or set up and for keeping them safe; we
      are not responsible for progress lost through device failure,
      uninstalling the App, or deleted backups.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">4. Ads and purchases</h2>
    <p>
      The free version shows banner ads provided by Google AdMob (see the
      <a href="/apps/canless/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>). The optional
      <strong>Premium</strong> is available as a monthly or yearly
      subscription or a one-off lifetime purchase, and small one-time
      <strong>shield packs</strong> are also offered. A subscription renews
      automatically until you cancel it in the Play Store; cancelling stops
      the renewal, not the running period. All purchases are processed and
      billed by Google Play, not by us, and are <strong>non-refundable</strong
      > except as required by law or by
      <a
        href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play's refund policies</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">5. Disclaimer and liability</h2>
    <p>
      The App is provided <strong>"as is"</strong>, without warranties of any
      kind, to the fullest extent permitted by law — we do not guarantee it
      will be uninterrupted or error-free, or that any figure it shows
      (savings, caffeine, sugar, or the timeline's general information) is
      accurate for your individual case. We are not liable for indirect or
      consequential damages or for lost data. Nothing here limits liability
      that cannot be limited by law, including your mandatory rights as a
      consumer.
    </p>

